<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 85 0 R/T(In this practical, frontend performance optimization was successfully achieved for the Task Management application by architecting route-based code splitting and component-level lazy loading using React.lazy\(\) and Suspense. )/E(In this practical, frontend performance optimization was successfully achieved for the Task Management application by architecting route-based code splitting and component-level lazy loading using React.lazy\(\) and Suspense. )/Pg 20 0 R/K[36]>>
