300 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 85 0 R/T(1. Route-Based Code Splitting: Successfully decoupled the monolithic client bundle into distinct route chunks \(Home, Projects, Contact, and Analytics\), reducing the initial entry bundle size from 177.2 kB to 158.8 kB and decreasing initial page load latency by 53.3%. )/E(1. Route-Based Code Splitting: Successfully decoupled the monolithic client bundle into distinct route chunks \(Home, Projects, Contact, and Analytics\), reducing the initial entry bundle size from 177.2 kB to 158.8 kB and decreasing initial page load latency by 53.3%. )/Pg 20 0 R/K[38]>>
endobj

301 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 85 0 R/T(2. Meaningful Fallback UI: Created an animated skeleton loading component integrated into Suspense boundaries, providing seamless visual transitions during dynamic chunk fetching. )/E(2. Meaningful Fallback UI: Created an animated skeleton loading component integrated into Suspense boundaries, providing seamless visual transitions during dynamic chunk fetching. )/Pg 20 0 R/K[39]>>
endobj

302 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 85 0 R/T(3. Heavy Component Chunking \(Supplementary 1\): Extracted an interactive SVG chart engine into an isolated sub-chunk \(HeavyChartEngine-*.js\), deferring heavy computational logic until user activation. )/E(3. Heavy Component Chunking \(Supplementary 1\): Extracted an interactive SVG chart engine into an isolated sub-chunk \(HeavyChartEngine-*.js\), deferring heavy computational logic until user activation. )/Pg 20 0 R/K[40]>>
endobj

303 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 85 0 R/T(4. Anti-Flicker Delay Protection \(Supplementary 2\): Implemented the lazyWithDelay helper to guarantee a 300ms minimum fallback duration, eliminating jarring layout flashes on high-speed broadband connections. )/E(4. Anti-Flicker Delay Protection \(Supplementary 2\): Implemented the lazyWithDelay helper to guarantee a 300ms minimum fallback duration, eliminating jarring layout flashes on high-speed broadband connections. )/Pg 20 0 R/K[41]>>
endobj

304 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 85 0 R/T(5. Component Memoization \(Supplementary 3\): Optimized TaskItem rendering with React.memo and custom prop comparison, preventing costly re-render cascades across sibling list items during parent state updates. )/E(5. Component Memoization \(Supplementary 3\): Optimized TaskItem rendering with React.memo and custom prop comparison, preventing costly re-render cascades across sibling list items during parent state updates. )/Pg 20 0 R/K[42]>>
