456 0 obj
<</Title(1. Route-Based Code Splitting: Successfully decoupled the monolithic client bundle into distinct route chunks \(Home, Projects, Contact, and Analytics\), reducing the initial entry bundle size from 177.2 kB to 158.8 kB and decreasing initial page load latency by 53.3%.)/Dest[20 0 R/Fit]/Parent 25 0 R/Prev 395 0 R/Next 514 0 R>>
endobj

457 0 obj
<</Title(4. Anti-Flicker Delay Protection \(Supplementary 2\): Implemented the lazyWithDelay helper to guarantee a 300ms minimum fallback duration, eliminating jarring layout flashes on high-speed broadband connections.)/Dest[20 0 R/Fit]/Parent 25 0 R/Prev 515 0 R/Next 396 0 R>>
endobj

